---
import PrintLayout from '@/layouts/PrintLayout.astro';
---

<PrintLayout title="Privacy Policy — Infinity Stone Solutions Inc.">

  <style>
    /* ── Document Header ── */
    .doc-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .doc-header__logo {
      height: 42px;
      width: auto;
    }

    .doc-header__right {
      text-align: right;
    }

    .doc-header__eyebrow {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      margin: 0 0 3px;
    }

    .doc-header__title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 900;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin: 0 0 2px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .doc-header__domain {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ── Section headings ── */
    .policy-section {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-primary);
      margin: 0 0 5px;
      padding-bottom: 3px;
      border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .subsection-title {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      margin: 8px 0 3px;
    }

    /* ── Body text ── */
    .policy-section p {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin: 0 0 4px;
    }

    .policy-section ul {
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      padding-left: 14px;
    }

    .policy-section ul li {
      font-size: 10.5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      margin-bottom: 2px;
    }

    strong {
      color: var(--color-ink);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ── Attribute table ── */
    .attr-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      margin: 6px 0 8px;
    }

    .attr-table td {
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .attr-table td:first-child {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-ink);
      white-space: nowrap;
      width: 130px;
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }

    .attr-table td:last-child {
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    }

    /* ── Two-column grid for Data Collection subsections ── */
    .data-collection-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0 20px;
    }

    /* ── Footer block ── */
    .policy-footer-block {
      margin-top: 8px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: var(--color-surface);
    }

    .policy-footer-block p {
      margin: 0 0 3px;
      font-size: 10.5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    }

    .policy-footer-block p:last-child { margin: 0; }

    .policy-footer-block strong {
      color: var(--color-ink);
    }

    /* ── Document footer (print only) ── */
    .doc-footer {
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    .doc-footer__left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .doc-footer__logo {
      height: 30px;
      width: auto;
    }

    .doc-footer__domain {
      font-size: 9.5px;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    }

    .doc-footer__right {
      font-size: 9.5px;
      color: var(--color-ink-soft);
      text-align: right;
    }

    @media print {
      @page { margin: 0.55in 0.65in; size: letter; }
      .doc-footer { display: flex !important; }
      a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Document Header -->
  <header class="doc-header">
    <img src="/brand/iss-logo-transparent.png" alt="Infinity Stone Solutions" class="doc-header__logo" />
    <div class="doc-header__right">
      <p class="doc-header__eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <p class="doc-header__title">Infinity Stone Solutions Inc.</p>
      <p class="doc-header__domain">infinitystonesolutions.com</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Privacy Commitment -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Privacy Commitment</h2>
    <p>
      For Infinity Stone Solutions Inc. (ISS), data protection is not merely a regulatory checkbox; it is a
      fundamental strategic requirement for a partner within the U.S. Defense Industrial Base (DIB). Our
      organizational philosophy is anchored by our core values: <strong>Innovation, Integrity, and Mission
      Success</strong>. We believe that "Integrity" in how we handle stakeholder information is the prerequisite
      for the "Mission Success" we deliver to the federal government. This policy serves as a transparent roadmap
      of our commitment to data stewardship.
    </p>
    <table class="attr-table">
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Legal Entity</td>
          <td>Infinity Stone Solutions Inc. (ISS)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Service Pillars</td>
          <td>Cloud & IT Modernization, AI & Analytics, GIS & Geospatial, Cybersecurity, Program Management</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- Strategic Alignment -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Strategic Alignment: Federal Transparency</h2>
    <p>
      As a trusted provider for agencies including the DoD, DHS, and DOI, ISS is held to a higher standard of data
      stewardship than traditional commercial entities. Because we operate at the intersection of national security
      and technological innovation, our privacy protocols are designed to protect the integrity of the information
      ecosystem surrounding our federal engagements. This ensures that every stakeholder — from a citizen visitor
      to a government contracting officer — can interact with our digital presence with absolute confidence.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Data Collection — two-column subsections -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Data Collection: Voluntary vs. Automatic</h2>
    <p>ISS categorizes information collection into distinct streams to maintain full transparency.</p>

    <div class="data-collection-grid">
      <!-- Left column -->
      <div>
        <p class="subsection-title">Voluntary Information</p>
        <p>Collected when you interact with ISS through the contact inquiry form or direct email.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Engagement data:</strong> Name, professional email, company or organization, phone (optional), area of interest (optional), and message content.</li>
          <li><strong>Processing:</strong> Submitted inquiries are processed through a third-party transactional email service and delivered to the ISS business inbox solely to respond to your request.</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="subsection-title">Automatic Technical Data — Hosting</p>
        <p>
          This website is hosted on <strong>Cloudflare's</strong> infrastructure. Cloudflare automatically logs
          technical indicators during user sessions — including IP addresses, browser type, and request metadata —
          for security, performance, and reliability purposes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column -->
      <div>
        <p class="subsection-title">Automatic Technical Data — Analytics</p>
        <p>
          This website uses <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to understand how visitors engage with the site.
          Google Analytics collects standard usage data — page views, session duration, browser type, approximate
          geographic location — and high-level interaction events like CTA clicks and form completions. Google
          Analytics uses cookies to distinguish unique visitors and maintain session state. Analytics data is
          processed by Google as a service provider for ISS marketing measurement only.
        </p>

        <p class="subsection-title">Automatic Technical Data — Spam Prevention</p>
        <p>
          The contact form uses an automated verification service to confirm that submissions are from human users.
          This process may collect limited browser signals and is used solely for spam prevention purposes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Data Utilization -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Data Utilization and Ethical Constraints</h2>
    <p>
      ISS operates under a strict <strong>"No Sale of Data" pledge</strong>. We do not sell, rent, or trade
      personal information to third parties. The utilization of collected information is strictly limited to
      three primary objectives:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Business Inquiry Response:</strong> Facilitating professional outreach and the delivery of mission-critical services.</li>
      <li><strong>Website Security and Integrity:</strong> Monitoring the digital environment to prevent unauthorized access, system degradation, or cyber threats.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal and Regulatory Compliance:</strong> Ensuring all data handling aligns with federal mandates and existing legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- CMMC -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">CMMC Alignment and Technical Security Architecture</h2>
    <p>
      As a contributor to the U.S. Defense Industrial Base, ISS has architected its security posture to align with
      the Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification (CMMC) and NIST standards. We employ a "defense-in-depth"
      strategy to protect sensitive information from evolving global threats. Key technical controls include:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Internal Enclave Strategy:</strong> Strict physical and logical separation between the public-facing website and the internal contract enclave. All contract-related data and CUI are processed in a secure environment isolated from the commercial website infrastructure.</li>
      <li><strong>Identity and Access Management:</strong> Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) and "least privilege" access controls ensure only authorized personnel interact with sensitive systems.</li>
      <li><strong>Advanced Encryption:</strong> Industry-standard encryption for all data at rest and in transit.</li>
      <li><strong>Vetted Cloud Architecture:</strong> ISS exclusively utilizes cloud providers vetted against rigorous federal security benchmarks.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      By maintaining logical isolation between the commercial website and the CMMC-regulated contract enclave, ISS
      effectively minimizes the attack surface, ensuring that website user data never enters the secure enclave
      where government-sensitive information is stored.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Individual Rights -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Individual Data Rights and External Governance</h2>
    <p>
      ISS facilitates the ability for individuals to exercise the rights of <strong>Access</strong>,
      <strong>Correction</strong>, and <strong>Deletion</strong> of personal data held by ISS, regardless of
      location. To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below. This website may contain links to
      external platforms; ISS is not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Policy Governance -->
  <div class="policy-section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Policy Governance and Contact Information</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy and Security Compliance Statement is a living security artifact, reviewed periodically
      and updated to reflect the latest in federal regulatory requirements and cybersecurity best practices.
    </p>

    <div class="policy-footer-block">
      <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 15, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Authority:</strong> ISS Security Office (Lead ISSO)</p>
      <p>For inquiries regarding this policy or our data protection protocols, contact ISS security leadership at info@infinitystonesolutions.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Document Footer (print only) -->
  <footer class="doc-footer">
    <div class="doc-footer__left">
      <img src="/brand/iss-logo-transparent.png" alt="" class="doc-footer__logo" />
      <span class="doc-footer__domain">infinitystonesolutions.com &nbsp;·&nbsp; info@infinitystonesolutions.com</span>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-footer__right">
      Last Updated: March 15, 2026
    </div>
  </footer>

</PrintLayout>
